    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... but even talking doesn't make the weight go away. it just makes me realize how much of it there is. every time i close my eyes, i just see the fires. i feel like i'm just drifting in a void, kaelen. there's no light at the end of this, is there? it feels like the story is just... done. like there's nothing left to write.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
